    Knowledge: the second judgement round's defects
    
    A repository's .git/config may hold only the settings git init writes, each
    line read by git's own grammar; git never looks into a nested repository; an
    interrupted operation's record is read only when every path is the store's
    own, and is put back path by path.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

